sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as 用户
  participant FE as 前端(Vue)
  participant API as 后端(Flask)
  participant CV as CV模块(YOLO/SAHI)
  participant TP as 拓扑模块
  participant LLM as LLM服务
  participant MX as MusicXML编码器

  U->>FE: 上传图片并点击“开始打谱”
  FE->>API: POST /api/upload (multipart/form-data)
  API->>API: 保存图片到 static/uploads
  API->>CV: detect_components(image)
  CV-->>API: yolo_boxes
  API->>TP: build_topology(yolo_boxes)
  TP-->>API: topology_json
  API->>TP: build_jianzi_sequence(topology_json)
  TP-->>API: jianzi_sequence
  API->>LLM: infer_pitch_duration(topology_json/sequence)
  LLM-->>API: llm_result
  API->>MX: generate_musicxml(llm_result)
  MX-->>API: music_xml
  API->>API: transform_llm_result_to_score_model(llm_result)
  API-->>FE: data{original_image_url,yolo_boxes,topology_json,jianzi_sequence,llm_result,score_model,music_xml}
  FE-->>U: 按阶段展示 CV->Topology->LLM->XML

  rect rgba(30, 120, 220, 0.08)
    U->>FE: 编辑 group 字段/标记删除
    FE->>API: POST /api/reflow_from_topology(topology_json)
